␀␀␀inMatrices␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇˇˇˇˇˇˇ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀outVertices␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇˇˇˇˇˇˇ␀␀␀␀$␀␀#version 310 es

#define HLSLCC_ENABLE_UNIFORM_BUFFERS 1
